From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Matthew R. Ochs" <mochs@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 7 Nov 2024 15:48:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: vfio/nvgrace-egm: Handle and convey EGM
 registration errors

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2119656

Update error handling within EGM regiration routine to catch and
return errors to the caller.

